# derivation's step 2 (`git apply`; crat-packaging 025, relay main/356, R1265-1).
#
# Rows of docs/agents/artifacts/2026-10-22-crat-packaging-025/d-rows.tsv, lane main, that it closes:
#   dead code    analyses/mir/ty.rs: `is_from_libtree` inside `TyGate::gated`. The gate (debug-only, a no-op in
