#                and the labels the three observers read (CRAT_RAW_BOUNDARY_CODE_FRAME, CRAT_ERA5_PROGRAM).
#                The inline readers are removed. The three observers' call sites are cut
#                (cursor_native::observe, nested_slice::observe, overlapping_pairs::publish); the functions
#                themselves are then dead and go by step 6's deadcut.
