#   - rewriter/diagnostics.rs: with era-5c's l2 instrument row;
#   - the 594 compiler-listed items: deadcut (step 6);
#   - regex / indexmap / cadical / etrace: step 7.
#
# Output: unchanged. None of these switches is set by the frame env the AE exports (only
# CRAT_ERA5_EXECUTION_ROLE=derive is set; its other readers stay). Checks on the patched b0eb75189:
# `cargo fmt --check` clean, and `cargo build --release --bin crat`.
